              <eventType />
              <eventScope>private</eventScope>
              <eventTypeData />
              <eventDescription>&lt;p&gt;If treatment has finished, include the discharge summary or concluding letter, where available, and relevant GP follow-up records. If treatment is ongoing, you may not have a discharge summary yet: include the latest relevant notes and information about current or planned treatment.&lt;/p&gt;</eventDescription>
              <purpose>Sources: SU-Handicap-report.md, documentation requirements and pitfalls; www.su.dk_handicaptillaeg_om-dokumentation.md; www.su.dk_handicaptillaeg_spoergsmaal-og-svar-om-handicaptillaeg.md. Guideline-based answer enriched with FAQ information.</purpose>
